+## M6.4-A评审HTTP与共享客户端（已有限验收）
+
+统一前缀`/api/v1/spaces/:space_id`。POST使用Idempotency-Key header，不接受body request_key；GET无副作用、不自动ACK。当前Bearer及同源Cookie/CSRF路径复用，全部新review成功/错误响应private,no-store。
+
+| 方法/后缀 | 成功data/码 |
+|---|---|
+| POST /review-requests | 原ReviewRequestView/201 |
+| GET /review-requests/:id | ReviewRequestReadView/200 |
+| GET /review-snapshots/:id | ReviewSnapshotView/200 |
+| GET /review-requests/:id/assignment | OwnReviewAssignmentView/200 |
+| POST /review-requests/:id/submissions | 原ReviewSubmissionAcknowledgement/201 |
+| GET /review-submissions/:id | ReviewSubmissionView/200 |
+| GET /review-requests/:id/submissions | {request_id,submissions:≤5}/200 |
+| POST /review-requests/:id/finalize | 不可变ReviewDecisionView/200 |
+| POST /review-requests/:id/cancel | 原固定版本ReviewRequestView/200 |
+| GET /review-requests/:id/status | ReviewStatusView/200 |
+| GET /review-requests/:id/decision | 不可变ReviewDecisionView/200 |
+| POST /review-requests/:requestId/artifacts | ReviewArtifactMetadata/201 |
+
+全部DTO/严格日期guard/OpenAPI单源；read绑定明确ID/父request，不能猜DTO未给的身份。新review客户端JSON沿既有executor并有1MiB响应上限/取消/超时；不泛称全部旧JSON同限。固定名单可见列表由服务同readSnapshot执行ACL与隐私，按实际revealed_at公开，其他sealed无IDs/内容/health。原写确认不加count，详情独立count。私有multipart复用原25MiB/stage/配额/最终fresh权限管线，metadata严格空对象或省略，支持普通FormData文本JSON和无filename application/json字段；不扩公共上传schema。私有metadata成功private,no-store，content原有缓存禁令保持。十二typed wrappers见[示例](../examples/review-http.md)。工具广告仍八个，评审CLI/MCP/Pi/Web未启用。
